# Product name: AirBridge32 -> DropBridge (user-visible surface only)
# 2026-10-30 13:45-13:52 (UTC+8). Offline rebuild + package; no radio or phone involved.

## why it was called AirBridge32
docs/用户任务书.md line 5: "项目名称：AirBridge32（暂定）" - the provisional name from the
task book, while the folder/repo stayed DropBridge. The iPhone showed it because the
receiver is started with --name AirBridge32.

## what changed (user-visible only)
src/supervisor/Program.cs   receiver --name, tray text, balloon titles, diagnostics header,
                            autostart registry value, single-instance mutex name
src/sfx/Program.cs          comments, error text, launcher lookup (DropBridge.exe then the
                            legacy AirBridge32.exe)
tools/Build-Supervisor.ps1  output build\supervisor\Release\DropBridge.exe and a legacy copy
                            AirBridge32.exe so the frozen test launchers keep working
