tools/make_icon.py, assets/  airbridge32.ico -> dropbridge.ico
packaging/README.txt, README.md, docs/DISTRIBUTION.md, docs/STATUS.md, tools/check_project.py
Unchanged: internal component names (airbridge_radio, radio_pipe_bridge, awdl_netd, awdld),
upstream/ research copies, historical docs and evidence logs.

