## verification
portable zip extracted to build\diagnostics\dist-check3: folder is DropBridge\, root exe
DropBridge.exe; --check exit 0, no MISSING; --auto-exit 45 reached the data plane and
the receiver logged "receiving as DropBridge (MacBookPro18,3)"; after the auto exit no
process, no listener on 49876/49877/8771/8772; %LOCALAPPDATA%\DropBridge and
%LOCALAPPDATA%\AirBridge32 both absent; data\keys, data\received, data\logs inside the folder.
single-file: dist\DropBridge.exe --extract produced app\20261030-135002 with backend\DropBridge.exe
and netd 4e7a65ee; --check on that tree exit 0, no MISSING.

## note
The portable-folder smoke test used the new supervisor + new netd (4e7a65ee: mDNS group join,
querier routing, opt-in outbound proxy). The data path is unchanged from the Q46 run, but a
